// The tier-two item that gates the elevator.
//
// The sharpest single expression of "depth within rules". Until M5 the
// elevator was 18 poles and a decision about *when*; now it is 18 poles,
// 6 rope and 2 mechanisms and a decision about whether the route you
// took can build one at all. A tower that walked the shaded branches
// every time has bamboo and no scrap, so no alloy, so no mechanisms —
// so it climbs its stairs. Route choice reaching into the transport
// layer is where this game's thesis lives (`SYSTEMS.md` §5.3).
#![enable(implicit_some)]
ItemDef(
    id: "item.mechanisms",
    name: "Mechanisms",
    glyph: "🛠",
    order: 40,
)
